{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "cedaddde-1f8f-8221-81c6-d9aea43b4773",
  "created_at": "2026-01-15T09:56:44-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Tony Fiore",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T09:54:47-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. Good morning."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T09:54:50-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Morning. Calling about a streetlight pole. Car hit it, now it leans."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T09:54:55-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, okay. A pole that's leaning after a car hit it. Can you tell me where it is?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T09:55:02-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "125 Kingston Avenue. Pole's out front, by the curb."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T09:55:06-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "125 Kingston Avenue, out front by the curb. Is that up on the Hill?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T09:55:12-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, Historic Hill. Corner of the property, right at the sidewalk."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T09:55:17-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. And when did this happen, do you know?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T09:55:21-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Couple nights ago, I think. Heard bang, looked out Tuesday morning, pole was tilted. Car's gone, of course."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T09:55:28-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so sometime Monday night into Tuesday. Is the light still working?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T09:55:33-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Still on. But it leans toward the sidewalk, more than it should. Wires up there. I'd like a crew to check the pole."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T09:55:41-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Absolutely, I'll put in a request for a crew to look at it. Anything on the ground, like a cracked base or loose wires hanging down?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T09:55:50-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No wires down. Base is cracked a little, dirt pushed up on one side."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T09:55:56-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Cracked base, dirt pushed up. I've got that noted. Do you want a call back, or is the address enough?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T09:56:03-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Call back is fine. Four oh one, five five five, oh one six oh."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T09:56:09-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four oh one, five five five, oh one six oh. And it's Tony?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T09:56:14-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Tony Fiore, yeah."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T09:56:16-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks, Tony. Someone should be out to look at it in the next few days, and they'll call if they need anything."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T09:56:24-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Good. I'm home most days, working in the back. Started throwing pottery on a wheel, so I'm usually in the shed."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T09:56:32-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, if you don't pick up, they'll leave a message. Is there anything else I can help with?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T09:56:39-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's it. Thanks."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T09:56:41-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Have a good day, Tony."
    }
  ],
